ER Model (After Normalisation)
The College Hostel Management & Maintenance System is modeled using the Entity-Relationship approach with strong entities, weak entities, and specialization. Room allocation is modeled as a group allocation: one student can belong to only one allocation, while a single allocation can contain multiple roommate students.

